      "help_en": "The WAF rule execution phase. This single-creation operation supports the following phases (it does not support `http_anti_scan` or `http_bot`. For these two phases, use the batch operation `BatchCreateWafRules`):\n`http_whitelist`: whitelist rule\n`http_custom`: custom rule\n`http_managed`: managed rule\n`http_ratelimit`: rate limiting rule\n`ip_access_rule`: IP access rule\n`http_security_level_rule`: security rule\n\nNote: `http_anti_scan` and `http_bot` can only be created through the batch operation. Passing these two values to this operation returns an error",
